-error)\r\n```\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nThis warning is not emitted in this case.\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n```\r\npylint 2.3.1\r\nastroid 2.2.5\r\nPython 3.7.2+ (default, Feb 27 2019, 15:41:59) \r\n[GCC 8.2.0]\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2818/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2818/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]